{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:fiber-metric-forms","title":"prop:fiber-metric-forms","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":4061,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#prop:fiber-metric-forms","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:fiber-metric-forms-pointwise]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-inner-product]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-wedge]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:wedge-covectors]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"prop:fiber-metric-forms","line":6913,"source":"\\begin{proposition}[The Fibre Metric on $\\Lambda^k T^*M$]\n\\label{prop:fiber-metric-forms}\n\n\\uses{def:fiber-metric-forms-pointwise, lem:fiber-metric-forms-inner-product, lem:fiber-metric-forms-wedge, lem:fiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise, lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth, def:wedge-covectors}\n\n\n\n\nThe fibre metric is the unique family of bilinear forms satisfying the determinant identity on wedges; each fibre is an inner product and pairings of smooth form fields are smooth.\n\\end{proposition}\n\\begin{proof}\n\n\\uses{lem:fiber-metric-forms-wedge,lem:fiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise,lem:fiber-metric-forms-inner-product,lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth}\n\\sketch The preceding lemmas give the identity, inner-product properties, smoothness, and pointwise uniqueness.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proposition</div></section>[The Fibre Metric on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\Lambda ^k T^*M$\">$\\Lambda ^k T^*M$</span>] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-70726f703a66696265722d6d65747269632d666f726d73\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Afiber-metric-forms-pointwise\">↗ def:fiber-metric-forms-pointwise</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Afiber-metric-forms-inner-product\">↗ lem:fiber-metric-forms-inner-product</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Afiber-metric-forms-wedge\">↗ lem:fiber-metric-forms-wedge</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Afiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise\">↗ lem:fiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Afiber-metric-forms-smooth\">↗ lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Awedge-covectors\">↗ def:wedge-covectors</a> <p></p>The fibre metric is the unique family of bilinear forms satisfying the determinant identity on wedges; each fibre is an inner product and pairings of smooth form fields are smooth.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Afiber-metric-forms-wedge\">↗ lem:fiber-metric-forms-wedge</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Afiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise\">↗ lem:fiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Afiber-metric-forms-inner-product\">↗ lem:fiber-metric-forms-inner-product</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Afiber-metric-forms-smooth\">↗ lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth</a> \\sketch The preceding lemmas give the identity, inner-product properties, smoothness, and pointwise uniqueness. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:wedge-alternating-forms","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:fiber-metric-forms-pointwise","title":"def:fiber-metric-forms-pointwise","label":"def:fiber-metric-forms-pointwise"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-inner-product","title":"lem:fiber-metric-forms-inner-product","label":"lem:fiber-metric-forms-inner-product"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-wedge","title":"lem:fiber-metric-forms-wedge","label":"lem:fiber-metric-forms-wedge"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise","title":"lem:fiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise","label":"lem:fiber-metric-forms-unique-pointwise"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth","title":"lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth","label":"lem:fiber-metric-forms-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:wedge-covectors","title":"def:wedge